'''Fusion''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.

==Appearance ==
Its blade uses the colors pink, blue, and orange to form a color fusion, hence the name. The guard and handle are black.

==Trivia==
